Plan: Use a generation counter and per-generation locks to prevent cross-generation interference.

```c
#define _XOPEN_SOURCE 700
#include <pthread.h>
#include <semaphore.h>
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <assert.h>
